{"term":{"label":"仁","occurrences":3,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"3B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-ii","title":"滕文公下","description":"陳代曰：「不見諸侯，宜若小然；今一見之，大則以王，小則以霸。且志曰：『枉尺而直尋』，宜若可為也。」\n孟子曰：「昔齊景公田，招虞人以旌，不至，將殺之。志士不忘在溝壑，勇士不忘喪其元。孔子奚取焉？取非其招不往也，如不待其招而往，何哉？且夫枉尺而直尋者，以利言也。如以利，則枉尋直尺而利，亦可為與？昔者趙簡子使王良與嬖奚乘，終"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"仲子","id":"仲子"},{"form":"何","id":"何"},{"form":"兄","id":"兄"},{"form":"充","id":"充"},{"form":"室","id":"室"},{"form":"後","id":"後"},{"form":"志","id":"志"},{"form":"求","id":"求"},{"form":"獸","id":"獸"},{"form":"知","id":"知"},{"form":"禽","id":"禽"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"食","id":"食"},{"form":"驅","id":"驅"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.8315312578732312,"source":"獸","target":"禽"},{"weight":1.1451323043030026,"source":"獸","target":"人"},{"weight":0.9444616088408515,"source":"獸","target":"食"},{"weight":2.243744592971112,"source":"獸","target":"仁"},{"weight":1.9560625205193314,"source":"獸","target":"充"},{"weight":1.3964467325839085,"source":"獸","target":"義"},{"weight":2.649209701079277,"source":"獸","target":"驅"},{"weight":0.5108256237659907,"source":"人","target":"食"},{"weight":0.8938178760220965,"source":"人","target":"後"},{"weight":0.8938178760220965,"source":"人","target":"仁"},{"weight":0.6061358035703155,"source":"人","target":"充"},{"weight":0.04652001563489291,"source":"人","target":"義"},{"weight":3.3423568816392217,"source":"仁","target":"義"},{"weight":3.4965075614664802,"source":"仁","target":"充"},{"weight":1.0986122886681098,"source":"仁","target":"食"},{"weight":2.243744592971112,"source":"知","target":"義"},{"weight":2.1102132003465894,"source":"室","target":"仲子"},{"weight":3.2088254890146994,"source":"室","target":"兄"},{"weight":1.9560625205193314,"source":"室","target":"義"},{"weight":2.6979998652487085,"source":"志","target":"求"},{"weight":1.9095425048844386,"source":"志","target":"食"},{"weight":1.0116009116784799,"source":"志","target":"何"},{"weight":2.6492097010